{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_012_mednext-title\">MedNeXt</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">贯穿 encoder、decoder 和上下采样的全 3D 大核 depthwise ConvNeXt block。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Fully 3D large-kernel depthwise ConvNeXt blocks deployed uniformly across encoder, bottleneck, decoder, and residual up/downsampling.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D 医学影像 patch</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D medical imaging patch</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">多尺度深监督的 3D 分割 logits</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Multi-scale deep-supervised 3D segmentation logits</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(a) · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-43901-8_39\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_012_mednext')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_012_mednext')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"MedNeXt original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(a)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/c26c478e5eb831fde12f.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(a) · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_012_mednext\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_012_mednext')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_012_mednext\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D Stem</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D Stem</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">将输入投影到 MedNeXt 基础通道。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging patch and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Stem).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"将输入投影到 MedNeXt 基础通道。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d medical imaging patch and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Stem).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D Stem\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Stem\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Stem</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将输入投影到 MedNeXt 基础通道。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging patch and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Stem).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"大核逐通道 3D 卷积扩大感受野，k 可随配置扩展。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes k³ DWConv to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"k³ DWConv\" data-node-name-en=\"k³ DWConv\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>k³ DWConv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">大核逐通道 3D 卷积扩大感受野，k 可随配置扩展。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes k³ DWConv to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"适应 3D 小 batch，并在通道混合前稳定激活。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs GroupNorm within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"GroupNorm\" data-node-name-en=\"GroupNorm\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>GroupNorm</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">适应 3D 小 batch，并在通道混合前稳定激活。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs GroupNorm within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"pointwise 卷积扩展通道后以 GELU 非线性变换。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 1×1×1 within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"1×1×1 扩展\" data-node-name-en=\"1×1×1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">1×1×1 扩展</span><span class=\"lang-en\">1×1×1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">pointwise 卷积扩展通道后以 GELU 非线性变换。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 1×1×1 within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"投影回块宽度并与输入做 residual add。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 1×1×1 within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"1×1×1 压缩\" data-node-name-en=\"1×1×1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">1×1×1 压缩</span><span class=\"lang-en\">1×1×1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">投影回块宽度并与输入做 residual add。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 1×1×1 within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可学习下采样块保持 MedNeXt block 语义连续。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Residual Down within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Residual Down\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual Down\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual Down</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可学习下采样块保持 MedNeXt block 语义连续。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Residual Down within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最低分辨率用深度与大核聚合广域 3D 上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs large-kernel Bottleneck within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"大核 Bottleneck\" data-node-name-en=\"large-kernel Bottleneck\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">大核 Bottleneck</span><span class=\"lang-en\">large-kernel Bottleneck</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最低分辨率用深度与大核聚合广域 3D 上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs large-kernel Bottleneck within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"转置卷积式 MedNeXt block 恢复分辨率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Residual Up within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Residual Up\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual Up\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual Up</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">转置卷积式 MedNeXt block 恢复分辨率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Residual Up within the core large kernel 3d conv unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"编码器同尺度特征连接到解码器，并可用 UpKern 初始化大核。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies U-shape Skips to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"U-shape Skips\" data-node-name-en=\"U-shape Skips\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>U-shape Skips</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">编码器同尺度特征连接到解码器，并可用 UpKern 初始化大核。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies U-shape Skips to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"主头和深监督头输出不同尺度分割。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces multi-scale deep-supervised 3d segmentation logits via Seg Heads.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"Seg Heads\" data-node-name-en=\"Seg Heads\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_012_mednext', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Seg Heads</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">主头和深监督头输出不同尺度分割。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces multi-scale deep-supervised 3d segmentation logits via Seg Heads.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"MedNeXt Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · MedNeXt 大核三维 ConvNeXt 块</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · MedNeXt 3D Depthwise Separable Inverted-Bottleneck Block</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"MedNeXt：核心公式 · MedNeXt 大核三维 ConvNeXt 块\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"12\" focusable=\"false\" he