.962663\"></use><use x=\"7.687538\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g16-44\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"15.986419\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g20-49\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"21.781308\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"28.974335\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-78\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"36.665496\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g10-185\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"40.381555\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-68\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"47.026634\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-87\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"55.88342\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-67\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"62.5285\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-111\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"67.50982\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-110\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"72.192257\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g23-118\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"77.500851\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g13-58\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"81.788113\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g7-2\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"87.031742\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g13-58\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"91.319004\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g7-2\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"96.562633\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g13-58\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"101.555216\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g10-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"105.271277\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g2-120\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"110.252597\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g10-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"114.068273\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g10-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"117.88392\" xlink:href=\"#m012_g10-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">传统 3D U-Net block 陈旧，Transformer 数据饥渴且代价高</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Legacy 3D U-Net 3×3×3 blocks had limited receptive fields, while 3D Transformers were memory-heavy and data-hungry.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把 ConvNeXt 大核 depthwise 设计系统扩展为全 3D encoder-decoder</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Generalize ConvNeXt's large-kernel depthwise inverted bottleneck into a fully 3D encoder–decoder with iterative kernel up-kernelling.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">残差上下采样、inverted bottleneck 与 depth/width/kernel compound scaling</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Residual inverted-bottleneck resampling layers and compound scaling across depth, width, and 3D kernel size (3³ → 5³ → 7³).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在统一医学分割复测中形成现代强纯卷积基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Establishes a top-performing pure 3D ConvNet baseline across large-scale unified medical segmentation benchmarks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">高价值对照；大核版本训练较慢</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Essential modern 3D CNN baseline; large 7×7×7 kernels increase training wall-clock time.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">用大核 depthwise 3D convolution 获得宽感受野，同时避免 full 3D convolution 的参数爆炸。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">inverted bottleneck 将空间混合与通道混合解耦。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">残差上下采样与 compound scaling 将 ConvNeXt block 扩展为完整 U 形分割系统。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Generalize ConvNeXt's large-kernel depthwise inverted bottleneck into a fully 3D encoder–decoder with iterative kernel up-kernelling.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Residual inverted-bottleneck resampling layers and compound scaling across depth, width, and 3D kernel size (3³ → 5³ → 7³).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: MedNeXt 3D Depthwise Separable Inverted-Bottleneck Block.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">是现代 3D CNN 强基线，适合与 UNETR、Swin UNETR 和 Mamba 模型做等预算比较。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">大核版本训练时间和对 target spacing 的敏感性必须与 Dice 增益一起报告。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Establishes a top-performing pure 3D ConvNet baseline across large-scale unified medical segmentation benchmarks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Essential modern 3D CNN baseline; large 7×7×7 kernels increase training wall-clock time.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-43901-8_39\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>MedNeXt: Transformer-driven Scaling of ConvNets for Medical Image Segmentation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/MedNeXt\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
